#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:2
msgid "CO₂の赤外スペクトル"
msgstr "Infrared Spectrum of CO₂"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:4
msgid "第一原理分子動力学で得たCO₂分子の運動からスペクトルを求め、計算手法による違いと実験値を比較します。"
msgstr ""
"We obtain the infrared spectrum from the motion of a CO₂ molecule in "
"first-principles molecular dynamics simulations, then compare the results"
" across methods and with experimental values."

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:8
msgid ":doc:`計算結果を読む <ir_spectrum>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Interpreting the Calculation Results <ir_spectrum>`"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`計算条件と再現手順 <reproduction>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Calculation Conditions and Reproduction Procedure <reproduction>`"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:13
msgid "CPMDで求めた双極子モーメントと振動座標のパワースペクトル"
msgstr "CPMD power spectra of the dipole moment and vibrational coordinates"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"CPMDで求めたパワースペクトルでは、1200〜1300 cm⁻¹付近に対称伸縮振動のピークが\\ "
"振動座標（右）に現れますが、双極子モーメント（左）には対応するピークが見られず、\\ 対称伸縮振動が赤外不活性であることが分かります。"
msgstr ""
"In the CPMD power spectra, the symmetric stretching mode produces a peak "
"near 1200–1300 cm⁻¹ in the vibrational coordinate (right), \\ but the "
"dipole moment (left) shows no corresponding peak. \\ This shows that the "
"symmetric stretching mode is IR inactive."

